WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.350
Let's switch on text reminders.

2
00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.280
It's four quick steps, and I'll be with you the whole way.

3
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.137
In Kairo, open Settings, then Messages,

4
00:00:09.177 --> 00:00:11.540
and tap Set up text messages.

5
00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.175
Texts go through ClickSend,

6
00:00:14.215 --> 00:00:17.910
an Aussie company you pay directly, just a few cents a text.

7
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.370
Open a free account.

8
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.070
It's like signing up for anything else.

9
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.210
Once you're in, tap the little key icon up the top.

10
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:29.210
You're after two things: your username and your API key.

11
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:33.150
Copy each one into Kairo and tap Connect.

12
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.402
Kairo checks them with ClickSend straight away,

13
00:00:35.442 --> 00:00:36.900
so you know they're right.

14
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.130
Your free credit covers the test.

15
00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.110
Before you go live, pop about $20 on.

16
00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.530
That's a few hundred texts.

17
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.250
Reminders and confirmations are already ticked.

18
00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.380
Check your mobile number, then send yourself a test.

19
00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.125
Texts only switch on once that test goes through,

20
00:00:55.165 --> 00:00:58.050
so your clients never get anything half-working.

21
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:00.830
And that's it!

22
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:03.650
Reminders now go by text and email.

23
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.140
If you ever need a hand, just tap Help.
